{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116047","id":3259937206,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7CTrG2","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116047","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116047.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116047.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116047","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116047/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116047/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116047/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2da8a78b36cb162e83d85b976a76d16ef76f43da","number":116047,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve texture_replace performance","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This modifies TextureStorage::texture_replace to perform better.\r\n\r\nCurrently, texture_replace deletes the old texture.  The side effect of this is the uniform set gets deleted and all instances using it get marked dirty so they can make a new uniform set for the new texture.  This works, but under various scenarios this causes big rendering delays when many instances suddenly need do a bunch of work.  This can be important if you are trying to implement texture streaming :stuck_out_tongue_winking_eye:  (see #113429).\r\n\r\nThis PR modifies texture_replace so instead of destroying the uniform set and triggering all instances to recreate the uniform set, we essentially duplicate the uniform set using the new texture and splice it in.  In flight draws can continue to use the old uniform set (it gets queued for deletion after its not in use).  New draws reference the new set.\r\n\r\nThis has removed a large delay I would occasionally see when large amounts of instances would appear or disappear.  There may be corner cases that aren't handled yet but a least for the 2d test case I made and my texture streaming this has worked well so far.  \r\n\r\nI've only test Vulkan and d3d12 but since its at the RenderDevice level I suspect it will be fine.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_ur